          <div style={{ fontSize: 20, color: "#8B9098", lineHeight: 1.5, textAlign: "center", marginTop: 14, fontWeight: 400 }}>Proteção real. <strong style={{ color: colors.ciano, fontWeight: 700 }}>Presença local.</strong></div>
        </div>
